# Prisma Rules — Работа с базой данных

## Активация

Применяется к файлам в `apps/api/src/**/*.service.ts` и при работе с `schema.prisma`.

---

## Source of Truth

**ALWAYS check first**: `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`
- All tables, relations, и indexes определены здесь
- User data isolation: большинство таблиц имеют `userId` field

---

## User Isolation

ВСЕ запросы к user data должны фильтроваться по userId:

```typescript
// ✅ Correct
await this.prisma.quest.findMany({
  where: { userId: userId }
});

// ❌ WRONG - exposes all users' data
await this.prisma.quest.findMany();
```

---

## Key Tables

| Table | Purpose | Key Fields |
|-------|---------|------------|
| `users` | User accounts | `id`, `telegramUsername` |
| `entries` | Raw user input | `userId`, `type`, `text` |
| `sessions` | AI analysis | `userId`, `entry_id`, `status` |
| `quests` | Development tasks | `userId`, `status`, `type` |
| `user_ability_state` | Skill progress | `user_id`, `node_id`, `progress` |
| `case_progress` | Case completion | `user_id`, `case_id` |
| `evidence` | Skill evidence | `userId`, `type`, `text` |
| `changelog` | Audit trail | `userId`, `action`, `entity_type` |

---

## Best Practices

### Используй `include` для избежания N+1 queries:

```typescript
// ✅ Correct - single query
const quest = await this.prisma.quest.findUnique({
  where: { id },
  include: { evidence: true }
});

// ❌ Wrong - N+1 problem
const quest = await this.prisma.quest.findUnique({ where: { id } });
const evidence = await this.prisma.evidence.findMany({ where: { questId: id } });
```

### Handle `null` cases explicitly:

```typescript
// ✅ Correct
const quest = await this.prisma.quest.findUnique({ where: { id } });
if (!quest) {
  throw new NotFoundException('Quest not found');
}

// ❌ Wrong - silent null
const quest = await this.prisma.quest.findUnique({ where: { id } });
return quest.title; // может быть null!
```

---

## Schema Changes Workflow

1. Edit `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma`
2. Run `npx prisma migrate dev --name description`
3. Update relevant DTOs в `apps/api/src/common/dto/`
4. Update service methods
5. Update shared types в `packages/shared` if needed

---

## Commands

```bash
cd apps/api

# GUI для database
npx prisma studio

# Create migration
npx prisma migrate dev --name <description>

# Regenerate client
npx prisma generate

# Push schema (dev only)
npx prisma db push
```
